%% Project Overview
%% Summary: Shows how authentication, booking, clinic operations, and cancellations connect through the app, scheduling service, and database.
sequenceDiagram
    actor Patient
    actor Doctor as Doctor / Admin
    actor Staff
    participant App as Booking App
    participant Auth as Auth and Access
    participant Schedule as Shared Scheduling Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over Patient,DB: Project Overview<br/>Shows how authentication, booking, clinic operations, and cancellations connect through the app, scheduling service, and database.

    rect rgb(238, 246, 255)
        Note over Patient,Auth: REF: Authentication<br/>See project-authentication.mmd
        Patient->>App: Enter email and request one-time code
        App->>Auth: Request patient code
        Auth->>DB: Save expiring code request
        Patient->>App: Submit code
        App->>Auth: Verify code and register patient if new
        Auth->>DB: Check code, register patient if new, start session
        DB-->>App: Patient session
    end

    rect rgb(241, 250, 242)
        Note over Doctor,Schedule: REF: Clinic setup and staff booking<br/>See clinic-operations.mmd
        Doctor->>App: Configure hours, breaks and special dates
        App->>Schedule: Save availability change
        Schedule->>DB: Validate conflicts and persist schedule
        Staff->>App: Enter patient details and confirm
        App->>Schedule: Confirm clinic-created booking
        Schedule->>DB: Lock doctor, recheck and commit appointment, occupancy, audit and receipt
        DB-->>Schedule: Commit succeeded
    end

    rect rgb(255, 249, 237)
        Note over Patient,Schedule: REF: Patient booking and WhatsApp<br/>See patient-booking-whatsapp.mmd
        Patient->>App: Select slot, enter details and optional WhatsApp consent
        App->>Schedule: Confirm booking request
        Schedule->>DB: Lock doctor, recheck slot and policy
        DB-->>Schedule: Commit succeeded
        Schedule-->>App: Confirmed appointment
        App-->>Patient: Show confirmation
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 240)
        Note over Patient,Schedule: REF: Patient cancellation and rebooking<br/>See patient-cancellation.mmd
        Patient->>App: Cancel from My appointments
        App->>Auth: Check patient session and appointment ownership
        Auth->>Schedule: Authorize patient self-cancellation
        Schedule->>DB: Lock doctor, cancel, release or block time, audit atomically
        DB-->>Schedule: Cancellation committed
    end

    rect rgb(255, 244, 237)
        Note over Doctor,Schedule: REF: Clinic cancellation<br/>See clinic-cancellation.mmd
        Doctor->>App: Cancel from agenda with reason and optional block/rebooking instruction
        Staff->>App: Cancel future confirmed clinic-created visit with reason
        App->>Auth: Check clinic session and appointment origin
        Auth->>Schedule: Authorize cancellation
        Schedule->>DB: Lock doctor, cancel, release or block time, audit atomically
        DB-->>Schedule: Cancellation committed
    end
